#
# Unified diffs applied by tools/capi_sync.py to the vendored Modules/ files
# (capi-design.md §8).  Edit the files under capi/modules, then run
# `tools/capi_sync.py --record`; the `#` notes before each diff are kept.
#
# Modules built unmodified, with what makes them work:
#   _collections  defaultdict: DICT + NATIVE; OrderedDict is the runtime's
#                 (PyODict_Type: python/odictobject.c).
#   _pickle       _Py_Mangle/_Py_IsPrivateName exported by D (P1).
#   _datetime     PyObject_Malloc + _PyObject_Init (= PyObject_Init, A);
#                 patched below to ready its static types.
#   _opcode       compat shims + capi/compat/qp_internals.c (F):
#                 ENABLE_SPECIALIZATION 0, no executors, no Py_STATS.
#   _asyncio      pycore_qp_tstate.h (_PyThreadStateImpl, struct _is),
#                 freelists disabled (pycore_freelist.h).
#   hashes        Modules/_hacl with CPython's LIBHACL flags; SIMD objects
#                 on x86_64 only (capi/Setup.qp @x86_64).
#   pyexpat       bundled Modules/expat (or CONFIG_PYTHON_CAPI_SYSTEM_EXPAT).
#   _elementtree  _PyDict_CopyAsDict (E1); expat through pyexpat's capsule.
#   cjkcodecs     _multibytecodec and the _codecs_* modules, unmodified.
#   _tracemalloc  capi/compat/pycore_tracemalloc.h over
#                 python/capi_tracemalloc.c (traces of the runtime).
#   _zoneinfo     static C types are immutable (PyType_Ready, B).
#   grp, pwd      _PyLong_FromUid/Gid, _Py_Uid/Gid_Converter (E2, over the
#                 native posix module's converters).
#   readline      PyOS_Readline / PyOS_ReadlineFunctionPointer (E2), used by
#                 input() and the basic REPL once the module is loaded.
#   _dbm          macOS ndbm (-DUSE_NDBM); "s#" accepts bytes (E2).
#   _hmac         Modules/_hacl HMAC over the hash objects of the hash modules.
#   fcntl, termios, syslog, _posixshmem, _multiprocessing, _uuid: unmodified
#                 (pyconfig.h entries; capi/compat/pycore_signal.h).
#   _ctypes       libffi through pkg-config (capi/Setup.qp @ffi); the libffi
#                 and loader HAVE_* of configure in capi/include/pyconfig.h;
#                 PEP 697 type data of the metaclasses (StgInfo) on Python
#                 classes: python/capi_mirror.c sizes their type mirrors.
#   all           Py_BUILD_CORE_MODULE: clinic KWTUPLE is NULL.

